ook window, Ribbon, formula bar, Name Box, sheet tabs, status bar, and the commands analysts use most.\">Learn the workbook window, Ribbon, formula bar, Name Box, sheet tabs, status bar, and the commands analysts use most.</p><small>35 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"workbooks-and-worksheets\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/workbooks-and-worksheets/\"><span>03</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Workbook ও Worksheet\" data-en=\"Workbooks and Worksheets\">Workbooks and Worksheets</h3><p data-bn=\"Workbook ও worksheet-এর পার্থক্য, raw data, calculation এবং report sheet আলাদা রাখার নিয়ম এবং একটি maintainable file structure তৈরি করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Structure an analytical workbook so raw data, transformations, calculations, and presentation do not become tangled.\">Structure an analytical workbook so raw data, transformations, calculations, and presentation do not become tangled.</p><small>35 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"cells-ranges-and-names\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/cells-ranges-and-names/\"><span>04</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Cell, Range ও Named Range\" data-en=\"Cells, Ranges, and Named Ranges\">Cells, Ranges, and Named Ranges</h3><p data-bn=\"Cell address, range এবং named range ব্যবহার করে data ও formula-কে স্পষ্ট, পুনর্ব্যবহারযোগ্য এবং audit-friendly করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Use cell addresses, ranges, selections, and names accurately so formulas and navigation remain understandable.\">Use cell addresses, ranges, selections, and names accurately so formulas and navigation remain understandable.</p><small>35 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"data-types-and-number-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/data-types-and-number-formats/\"><span>05</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Data Type ও Number Format\" data-en=\"Data Types and Number Formats\">Data Types and Number Formats</h3><p data-bn=\"Text, number, date, logical value ও error type চিনবেন এবং display format ও underlying value-এর পার্থক্য বুঝবেন।\" data-en=\"Distinguish stored values from display formats and prevent text, date, currency, and percentage errors.\">Distinguish stored values from display formats and prevent text, date, currency, and percentage errors.</p><small>40 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"navigation-and-shortcuts\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/navigation-and-shortcuts/\"><span>06</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Navigation, Selection ও Shortcut\" data-en=\"Navigation, Selection, and Shortcuts\">Navigation, Selection, and Shortcuts</h3><p data-bn=\"বড় worksheet-এ দ্রুত চলাচল, সঠিক range select, Go To, freeze panes এবং প্রয়োজনীয় keyboard shortcut ব্যবহার করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Move through large worksheets efficiently and select exactly the data you intend to analyze.\">Move through large worksheets efficiently and select exactly the data you intend to analyze.</p><small>30 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a></div></section><section class=\"tutorial-index-module\"><div class=\"tutorial-module-heading\"><span>02</span><h2 data-bn=\"Data organize ও control\" data-en=\"Organize and Control Data\">Organize and Control Data</h2></div><div class=\"tutorial-index-list\"><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"enter-edit-and-fill-data\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/enter-edit-and-fill-data/\"><span>07</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Data enter, edit ও fill\" data-en=\"Enter, Edit, and Fill Data\">Enter, Edit, and Fill Data</h3><p data-bn=\"Data entry, edit, AutoFill, Flash Fill এবং Paste Special ব্যবহার করে দ্রুত ও নিয়ন্ত্রিতভাবে worksheet পূরণ করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Enter records safely, use AutoFill and Flash Fill appropriately, and avoid patterns that damage analytical tables.\">Enter records safely, use AutoFill and Flash Fill appropriately, and avoid patterns that damage analytical tables.</p><small>35 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"import-csv-and-text\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/import-csv-and-text/\"><span>08</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"CSV ও Text file import\" data-en=\"Import CSV and Text Files\">Import CSV and Text Files</h3><p data-bn=\"CSV ও text file import করার সময় delimiter, encoding, locale, leading zero, date এবং number type সঠিকভাবে নিয়ন্ত্রণ করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Import delimited files without losing leading zeros, dates, encodings, or column structure.\">Import delimited files without losing leading zeros, dates, encodings, or column structure.</p><small>40 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"sort-data-safely\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/sort-data-safely/\"><span>09</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Data safely sort\" data-en=\"Sort Data Safely\">Sort Data Safely</h3><p data-bn=\"এক বা একাধিক key দিয়ে সম্পূর্ণ record নিরাপদে sort করা এবং partial sort-এর কারণে data relationship নষ্ট হওয়া প্রতিরোধ করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Sort entire records by one or more fields without disconnecting values from their rows.\">Sort entire records by one or more fields without disconnecting values from their rows.</p><small>35 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"filter-data\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/filter-data/\"><span>10</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Data filter\" data-en=\"Filter Data\">Filter Data</h3><p data-bn=\"Criteria অনুযায়ী প্রয়োজনীয় row দেখানো, filtered result বিশ্লেষণ এবং hidden row-এর প্রভাব বুঝে SUBTOTAL-এর মতো function ব্যবহার করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Display only records that meet conditions while leaving the underlying dataset intact.\">Display only records that meet conditions while leaving the underlying dataset intact.</p><small>35 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card