utorial-index-module\"><div class=\"tutorial-module-heading\"><span>03</span><h2 data-bn=\"Formula Foundation\" data-en=\"Formula Foundations\">Formula Foundations</h2></div><div class=\"tutorial-index-list\"><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"formula-syntax-and-operators\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/formula-syntax-and-operators/\"><span>14</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Formula Syntax ও Operator\" data-en=\"Formula Syntax and Operators\">Formula Syntax and Operators</h3><p data-bn=\"Excel formula কীভাবে = দিয়ে শুরু হয়, operator precedence, function argument ও logical comparison কীভাবে কাজ করে তা শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Write formulas with the correct equal sign, references, operators, functions, arguments, and order of operations.\">Write formulas with the correct equal sign, references, operators, functions, arguments, and order of operations.</p><small>45 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"relative-absolute-and-mixed-references\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/relative-absolute-and-mixed-references/\"><span>15</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Relative, Absolute ও Mixed Reference\" data-en=\"Relative, Absolute, and Mixed References\">Relative, Absolute, and Mixed References</h3><p data-bn=\"Formula copy করার সময় relative, absolute ও mixed reference কীভাবে বদলায় বা স্থির থাকে এবং কখন $ ব্যবহার করতে হয় তা শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Control how cell references change when formulas are copied across rows and columns.\">Control how cell references change when formulas are copied across rows and columns.</p><small>45 min · Beginner</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"sum-average-min-max\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/sum-average-min-max/\"><span>16</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"SUM, AVERAGE, MIN ও MAX\" data-en=\"SUM, AVERAGE, MIN, and MAX\">SUM, AVERAGE, MIN, and MAX</h3><p data-bn=\"SUM, AVERAGE, MIN ও MAX দিয়ে total, average এবং extreme value বের করে 