IFS\" data-en=\"COUNTIF and COUNTIFS\">COUNTIF and COUNTIFS</h3><p data-bn=\"এক বা একাধিক criterion অনুযায়ী record গণনা করে exception, segment, status ও frequency metric তৈরি করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Count records that meet category, threshold, date, and quality conditions.\">Count records that meet category, threshold, date, and quality conditions.</p><small>40 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"averageif-and-averageifs\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/averageif-and-averageifs/\"><span>23</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"AVERAGEIF ও AVERAGEIFS\" data-en=\"AVERAGEIF and AVERAGEIFS\">AVERAGEIF and AVERAGEIFS</h3><p data-bn=\"নির্দিষ্ট condition পূরণ করা observation-এর average বের করে segment comparison ও operational metric বিশ্লেষণ করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Calculate conditional means while protecting the denominator and interpreting segment differences responsibly.\">Calculate conditional means while protecting the denominator and interpreting segment differences responsibly.</p><small>40 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"text-cleaning-functions\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/text-cleaning-functions/\"><span>24</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"TRIM, CLEAN, SUBSTITUTE ও VALUE\" data-en=\"TRIM, CLEAN, SUBSTITUTE, and VALUE\">TRIM, CLEAN, SUBSTITUTE, and VALUE</h3><p data-bn=\"TRIM, CLEAN, SUBSTITUTE ও VALUE দিয়ে extra space, nonprinting character, inconsistent text এবং text-number পরিষ্কার করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Repair common text problems before grouping, joining, or converting values.\">Repair common text problems before grouping, joining, or converting values.</p><small>45 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"text-extraction-functions\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/text-extraction-functions/\"><span>25</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"LEFT, RIGHT, MID ও LEN\" data-en=\"LEFT, RIGHT, MID, and LEN\">LEFT, RIGHT, MID, and LEN</h3><p data-bn=\"LEFT, RIGHT, MID ও LEN দিয়ে code, prefix, suffix এবং compound identifier থেকে প্রয়োজনীয় text অংশ বের করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Extract predictable pieces from fixed or semi-structured text and validate the expected length.\">Extract predictable pieces from fixed or semi-structured text and validate the expected length.</p><small>40 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"text-combining-functions\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/text-combining-functions/\"><span>26</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"CONCAT, TEXTJOIN ও &amp; Operator\" data-en=\"CONCAT, TEXTJOIN, and the &amp; Operator\">CONCAT, TEXTJOIN, and the &amp; Operator</h3><p data-bn=\"&amp;, CONCAT ও TEXTJOIN দিয়ে একাধিক cell-এর text নির্দিষ্ট delimiterসহ একত্র করে readable label বা key তৈরি করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Combine fields into readable labels or keys without losing control of delimiters and blanks.\">Combine fields into readable labels or keys without losing control of delimiters and blanks.</p><small>35 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"modern-text-splitting\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/modern-text-splitting/\"><span>27</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"TEXTBEFORE, TEXTAFTER ও TEXTSPLIT\" data-en=\"TEXTBEFORE, TEXTAFTER, and TEXTSPLIT\">TEXTBEFORE, TEXTAFTER, and TEXTSPLIT</h3><p data-bn=\"TEXTBEFORE, TEXTAFTER ও TEXTSPLIT দিয়ে delimiterভিত্তিক text-কে আধুনিক dynamic array পদ্ধতিতে ভাগ করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Split delimiter-based text with modern functions and understand version compatibility.\">Split delimiter-based text with modern functions and understand version compatibility.</p><small>40 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"dates-times-and-serials\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/dates-times-and-serials/\"><span>28</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Date, Time ও Serial Value\" data-en=\"Dates, Times, and Serial Values\">Dates, Times, and Serial Values</h3><p data-bn=\"Excel date ও time-এর serial value, valid date entry, date arithmetic এবং display format বুঝতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Understand how Excel stores dates and times so calculations, filters, and charts behave correctly.\">Understand how Excel stores dates and times so calculations, filters, and charts behave correctly.</p><small>45 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"date-analysis-functions\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/date-analysis-functions/\"><span>29</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"TODAY, YEAR, MONTH, EOMONTH ও NETWORKDAYS\" data-en=\"TODAY, YEAR, MONTH, EOMONTH, and NETWORKDAYS\">TODAY, YEAR, MONTH, EOMONTH, and NETWORKDAYS</h3><p data-bn=\"TODAY, YEAR, MONTH, EOMONTH ও NETWORKDAYS দিয়ে period label, aging, month-end এবং working-day metric তৈরি করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Build reporting periods, extract calendar attributes, and calculate working-day durations.\">Build reporting periods, extract calendar attributes, and calculate working-day durations.</p><small>45 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a></div></section><section class=\"tutorial-index-module\"><div class=\"tutorial-module-heading\"><span>05</span><h2 data-bn=\"Lookup ও Dynamic Array\" data-en=\"Lookups and Dynamic Arrays\">Lookups and Dynamic Arrays</h2></div><div class=\"tutorial-index-list\"><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"xlookup\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/xlookup/\"><span>30</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"XLOOKUP\" data-en=\"XLOOKUP\">XLOOKUP</h3><p data-bn=\"XLOOKUP দিয়ে key খুঁজে related value return, exact match default ব্যবহার এবং not-found result স্পষ্টভাবে handle করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Retrieve a corresponding value from a table with exact-match defaults and explicit not-found handling.\">Retrieve a corresponding value from a table with exact-match defaults and explicit not-found h