ons, and table limitations.\">Understand formulas that return multiple values and manage spill ranges, obstructions, and table limitations.</p><small>45 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"filter-function\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/filter-function/\"><span>34</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"FILTER Function\" data-en=\"FILTER Function\">FILTER Function</h3><p data-bn=\"FILTER function দিয়ে criteria অনুযায়ী live row subset তৈরি এবং empty result নিরাপদভাবে handle করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Return only rows meeting Boolean conditions and create responsive analyst views without manually hiding records.\">Return only rows meeting Boolean conditions and create responsive analyst views without manually hiding records.</p><small>50 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"sort-sortby-and-unique\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/sort-sortby-and-unique/\"><span>35</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"SORT, SORTBY ও UNIQUE\" data-en=\"SORT, SORTBY, and UNIQUE\">SORT, SORTBY, and UNIQUE</h3><p data-bn=\"SORT, SORTBY ও UNIQUE দিয়ে dynamic sorted list, distinct category এবং reusable report source তৈরি করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Build automatically ordered and deduplicated lists that update when source tables change.\">Build automatically ordered and deduplicated lists that update when source tables change.</p><small>45 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"let-and-readable-formulas\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/let-and-readable-formulas/\"><span>36</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"LET ও Readable Formula Design\" data-en=\"LET and Readable Formula Design\">LET and Readable Formula Design</h3><p data-bn=\"LET দিয়ে intermediate calculation-এর নাম রেখে formula ছোট, readable, efficient ও audit-friendly করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Name intermediate calculations inside formulas and make complex logic easier to read, debug, and maintain.\">Name intermediate calculations inside formulas and make complex logic easier to read, debug, and maintain.</p><small>50 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a></div></section><section class=\"tutorial-index-module\"><div class=\"tutorial-module-heading\"><span>06</span><h2 data-bn=\"Analysis, PivotTable ও Visualization\" data-en=\"Analysis, PivotTables, and Visualization\">Analysis, PivotTables, and Visualization</h2></div><div class=\"tutorial-index-list\"><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"conditional-formatting\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/conditional-formatting/\"><span>37</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Conditional Formatting\" data-en=\"Conditional Formatting\">Conditional Formatting</h3><p data-bn=\"Rule, threshold, formula, data bar ও color scale ব্যবহার করে গুরুত্বপূর্ণ pattern ও exception highlight করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Highlight meaningful conditions with rules while avoiding decorative color that obscures the data.\">Highlight meaningful conditions with rules while avoiding decorative color that obscures the data.</p><small>45 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"descriptive-statistics-in-excel\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/descriptive-statistics-in-excel/\"><span>38</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Excel-এ Descriptive Statistics\" data-en=\"Descriptive Statistics in Excel\">Descriptive Statistics in Excel</h3><p data-bn=\"Excel function ও Analysis ToolPak দিয়ে count, mean, median, standard deviation, percentile ও distribution summary তৈরি করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Use built-in functions to summarize center, spread, position, and shape while interpreting each measure in context.\">Use built-in functions to summarize center, spread, position, and shape while interpreting each measure in context.</p><small>55 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"correlation-and-trend-functions\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/correlation-and-trend-functions/\"><span>39</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Correlation, Covariance ও Trend Function\" data-en=\"Correlation, Covariance, and Trend Functions\">Correlation, Covariance, and Trend Functions</h3><p data-bn=\"CORREL, COVARIANCE, SLOPE, INTERCEPT ও FORECAST.LINEAR দিয়ে linear relationship explore করবেন এবং causation দাবি না করার সীমা বুঝবেন।\" data-en=\"Measure linear association and fit simple trends without confusing association with causation.\">Measure linear association and fit simple trends without confusing association with causation.</p><small>55 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"what-if-analysis\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/what-if-analysis/\"><span>40</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"What-If Analysis: Goal Seek, Scenario ও Data Table\" data-en=\"What-If Analysis: Goal Seek, Scenarios, and Data Tables\">What-If Analysis: Goal Seek, Scenarios, and Data Tables</h3><p data-bn=\"Goal Seek, Scenario Manager ও Data Table দিয়ে assumption পরিবর্তনে output কীভাবে বদলায় তা বিশ্লেষণ করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Explore how assumptions affect outputs and solve for an input required to reach a target.\">Explore how assumptions affect outputs and solve for an input required to reach a target.</p><small>50 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"pivottable-foundations\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/pivottable-foundations/\"><span>41</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"PivotTable Foundation\" data-en=\"PivotTable Foundations\">PivotTable Foundations</h3><p data-bn=\"Tidy data থেকে PivotTable তৈরি করে row, column, value ও filter area ব্যবহার করে দ্রুত summary ও comparison করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Summarize large tidy tables by dragging fields into rows, columns, values, and filters.\">Summarize large tidy tables by dragging fields into rows, columns, values, and filters.</p><small>55 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"pivot-grouping-calculations-and-slicers\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/pivot-grouping-calculations-and-slicers/\"><span>42</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Pivot Grouping, Calculation ও Slicer\" data-en=\"Pivot Grouping, Calculations, and Slicers\">Pivot Grouping, Calculations, and Slicers</h3><p data-bn=\"Date/number group, Show Values As, calculated analysis এবং slicer দিয়ে PivotTable-কে interactive analytical report-এ রূপ দিতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Group dates and numeric values, change value displays, and provide clear interactive filtering.\">Group dates and numeric values, change value displays, and provide clear interactive filtering.</p><small>55 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"charts-for-data-analysis\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/charts-for-data-analysis/\"><span>43</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Data Analysis-এর জন্য Chart\" data-en=\"Charts for Data Analysis\">Charts for Data Analysis</h3><p data-bn=\"Analytical question অনুযায়ী bar, line, scatter, histogram বা combination chart বেছে নিয়ে misleading design এড়াতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Choose chart types according to the analytical question, encode values honestly, and remove distractions.\">Choose chart types according to the analytical question, encode values honestly, and remove distractions.</p><small>50 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"dashboard-design\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/dashboard-design/\"><span>44</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Excel Dashboard Design\" data-en=\"Excel Dashboard Design\">Excel Dashboard Design</h3><p data-bn=\"KPI, chart, filter, layout, hierarchy ও annotation সমন্বয় করে পরিষ্কার, interactive ও decision-ready Excel dashboard তৈরি করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Create a focused, refreshable, and auditable one-page analytical report rather than a crowded collage of charts.\">Create a focused, refreshable, and auditable one-page analytical report rather than a crowded collage of charts.</p><small>60 min · Intermediate</small></div><b>→</b></a></div></section><section class=\"tutorial-index-module\"><div class=\"tutorial-module-heading\"><span>07</span><h2 data-bn=\"Power Query, Data Model ও Advanced Analysis\" data-en=\"Power Query, Data Model, and Advanced Analysis\">Power Query, Data Model, and Advanced Analysis</h2></div><div class=\"tutorial-index-list\"><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"power-query-fundamentals\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/power-query-fundamentals/\"><span>45</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Power Query Foundation\" data-en=\"Power Query Fundamentals\">Power Query Fundamentals</h3><p data-bn=\"Power Query দিয়ে source connect, preview, type set, transformation step record এবং refreshable data-preparation workflow তৈরি করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Create repeatable import and transformation steps instead of manually cleaning the same files each month.\">Create repeatable import and transformation steps instead of manually cleaning the same files each month.</p><small>55 min · Advanced</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"power-query-transformations\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/power-query-transformations/\"><span>46</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Power Query Cleaning ও Transformation\" data-en=\"Power Query Cleaning and Transformations\">Power Query Cleaning and Transformations</h3><p data-bn=\"Power Query-তে column select/rename, text clean, type change, filter, pivot, unpivot ও custom transformation করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Use type, text, numeric, date, null, pivot, unpivot, and grouping operations in a transparent sequence.\">Use type, text, numeric, date, null, pivot, unpivot, and grouping operations in a transparent sequence.</p><small>60 min · Advanced</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"power-quer