and relationships.</p><small>65 min · Advanced</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"analysis-toolpak\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/analysis-toolpak/\"><span>50</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Analysis ToolPak\" data-en=\"Analysis ToolPak\">Analysis ToolPak</h3><p data-bn=\"Analysis ToolPak দিয়ে descriptive statistics, regression ও অন্যান্য analytical output তৈরি এবং input/output যাচাই করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Use Excel’s optional statistical add-in for descriptive statistics, regression, histograms, and other procedures while validating assumptions and outputs.\">Use Excel’s optional statistical add-in for descriptive statistics, regression, histograms, and other procedures while validating assumptions and outputs.</p><small>60 min · Advanced</small></div><b>→</b></a></div></section><section class=\"tutorial-index-module\"><div class=\"tutorial-module-heading\"><span>08</span><h2 data-bn=\"Quality, Delivery ও Final Project\" data-en=\"Quality, Delivery, and Final Project\">Quality, Delivery, and Final Project</h2></div><div class=\"tutorial-index-list\"><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"formula-auditing-and-controls\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/formula-auditing-and-controls/\"><span>51</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Formula Auditing ও Control Check\" data-en=\"Formula Auditing and Control Checks\">Formula Auditing and Control Checks</h3><p data-bn=\"Trace, Show Formulas, Evaluate Formula ও reconciliation check ব্যবহার করে formula error ও inconsistent output শনাক্ত করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Trace dependencies, inspect formulas, detect inconsistencies, and reconcile critical outputs before delivery.\">Trace dependencies, inspect formulas, detect inconsistencies, and reconcile critical outputs before delivery.</p><small>55 min · Advanced</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"workbook-performance-and-maintainability\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/workbook-performance-and-maintainability/\"><span>52</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Workbook Performance ও Maintainability\" data-en=\"Workbook Performance and Maintainability\">Workbook Performance and Maintainability</h3><p data-bn=\"অপ্রয়োজনীয় volatile formula, oversized range ও duplicate logic কমিয়ে workbook দ্রুত, readable ও maintainable করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Keep analytical workbooks responsive, understandable, and safe to update as data and complexity grow.\">Keep analytical workbooks responsive, understandable, and safe to update as data and complexity grow.</p><small>50 min · Advanced</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"sharing-protection-and-version-control\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/sharing-protection-and-version-control/\"><span>53</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Sharing, Protection ও Version Control\" data-en=\"Sharing, Protection, and Version Control\">Sharing, Protection, and Version Control</h3><p data-bn=\"Sharing, cell protection, controlled input, naming convention ও version history দিয়ে workbook delivery নিরাপদ ও traceable করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Deliver workbooks with clear ownership, protected logic, controlled inputs, and a recoverable history.\">Deliver workbooks with clear ownership, protected logic, controlled inputs, and a recoverable history.</p><small>45 min · Advanced</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"excel-analyst-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/excel-analyst-workflow/\"><span>54</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"End-to-End Excel Analyst Workflow\" data-en=\"End-to-End Excel Analyst Workflow\">End-to-End Excel Analyst Workflow</h3><p data-bn=\"Business question থেকে data import, cleaning, calculation, validation, visualization ও insight delivery পর্যন্ত end-to-end Excel analyst workflow শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Combine question definition, import, cleaning, validation, analysis, visualization, and communication into one repeatable process.\">Combine question definition, import, cleaning, validation, analysis, visualization, and communication into one repeatable process.</p><small>60 min · Advanced</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"retail-sales-project-data-preparation\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/retail-sales-project-data-preparation/\"><span>55</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Final Project I: Retail Sales Data Prepare\" data-en=\"Final Project I: Prepare Retail Sales Data\">Final Project I: Prepare Retail Sales Data</h3><p data-bn=\"Final project-এর retail sales data import, profile, clean, type-check, table/Power Query source তৈরি এবং control total সংরক্ষণ করবেন।\" data-en=\"Import, profile, clean, and model the course retail-sales dataset using auditable Excel and Power Query steps.\">Import, profile, clean, and model the course retail-sales dataset using auditable Excel and Power Query steps.</p><small>90 min · Advanced</small></div><b>→</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-index-card\" data-chapter-card=\"retail-sales-project-dashboard\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/retail-sales-project-dashboard/\"><span>56</span><div><h3 data-bn=\"Final Project II: Analyze ও Dashboard Build\" data-en=\"Final Project II: Analyze and Build the Dashboard\">Final Project II: Analyze and Build the Dashboard</h3><p data-bn=\"Validated retail data থেকে KPI, PivotTable, chart, dashboard, finding, recommendation ও limitationসহ portfolio-ready deliverable তৈরি করবেন।\" data-en=\"Create formulas, PivotTables, charts, KPIs, insights, and a documented delivery package for the retail-sales project.\">Create formulas, PivotTables, charts, KPIs, insights, and a documented delivery package for the retail-sales project.</p><small>120 min · Advanced</small></div><b>→</b></a></div></section></div><aside class=\"course-side-card\"><h2>Course tools</h2><a href=\"/exercises/excel-data-analytics/\">Chapter exercises <span>→</span></a><a href=\"/examples/excel-data-analytics/\">Worked examples <